.Dd June 14, 2026
.Dt MBT_MAGNET 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mbt_magnet_parse ,
.Nm mbt_magnet_free
.Nd Magnet URI parsing and management.
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In mbt/magnet.h
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_magnet_parse "const char *uri" "struct mbt_magnet *out"
.Ft void
.Fn mbt_magnet_free "struct mbt_magnet *m"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm mbt_magnet
module provides utilities for parsing and managing BitTorrent magnet URIs.
A magnet URI contains information such as the infohash, display name, tracker URLs, and known peer addresses.
.Sh FUNCTIONS
The following functions manage magnet URI structures:
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It Fn mbt_magnet_parse
Parses a magnet URI string into a
.Vt mbt_magnet
structure. Returns 0 on success or a negative error code on failure.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It Fn mbt_magnet_free
Frees the internal dynamically allocated members of a
.Vt mbt_magnet
structure, such as the display name and tracker strings. It does not free the structure itself.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mbt 3
